*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.eot binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.apk binary
*.ipa binary
*.jks binary
*.p12 binary
*.mobileprovision binary
